  "What does deleting transcripts cost, and what wins it back? (68 AMI questions)",
  "AMI, 5 meetings, 68 questions (13 DEV + 55 TEST), each answered over its own meeting(s).\nRight: paired wins–losses on the same questions (exact sign test); bold = p < 0.05 on correct.",
  "A is Granola's own Chat; B to D are our reader (claude-opus-5-5) over each app's notes, so A→B mixes deletion with a change of model. Judge claude-sonnet-5-5 against AMI's human summaries; it over-counts errors (see Answers). Not replicated: in the earlier private study (author's 4 meetings, 47 DEV questions) D scored 87% vs Granola's agent 89%; here A beats D on not wrong, 17–6 (p = 0.035, uncorrected)."
